  "solution": {
    "text": "In first case, when <math><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></math> of the cube inside water, <br/><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ρ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ρ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math>  <br/><math><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ρ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ρ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0.3</mn></math>  <br/>Additional weight we can put <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi></math> is, <br/><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ρ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ρ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi></math>  <br/><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ρ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ρ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math>  <br/><math><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0.5</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>×</mo><mn>0.7</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math>  <br/><math><mo>=</mo><mn>87.5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math>  <br/>Addition of mass that we can put <math><mo>=</mo><mn>87.5</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math>"
